<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LLM Hallucination Detection: A Fast Fourier Transform Method Based on Hidden Layer Temporal Signals

<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span><span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline ltx_font_italic">Citation</span>:
<span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Authors. Title. Pages…. DOI:000000/11111.</span></span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
